# Said once, at install: on every upgrade it would be noise.
post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
Sinopia is in the app launcher. `sinopia` opens the most recent board,
`sinopia --new` a new one.

The rest is opt-in, for each person who wants it:

  The bar widget, on the Omarchy shell
    mkdir -p ~/.config/omarchy/plugins
    ln -s /usr/share/sinopia/plugin ~/.config/omarchy/plugins/edu.sinopia
    omarchy plugin enable edu.sinopia right

  A theme change reaching a board left open on another monitor
    omarchy hook install theme-set /usr/share/sinopia/omarchy/sinopia
    omarchy hook install font-set /usr/share/sinopia/omarchy/sinopia

  The skill that lets the agents here read and add frames
    /usr/share/sinopia/skills/sinopia/install.sh

Boards live in ~/.local/share/sinopia, and removing the package leaves
them there.
EOF
}
